{
  "id": "valid-code",
  "title": {
    "tr": "fullmatch ile denetle",
    "en": "Check with fullmatch"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "starter": "starter.{lang}.py",
  "solution": "solution.py",
  "timeout_sec": 30,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`re.fullmatch(...)` eşleşmezse `None` döner.",
      "en": "`re.fullmatch(...)` returns `None` when there is no match."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef valid_code(code):\n    return re.fullmatch(r\"[A-Z]{2}-[0-9]{4}\", code) is not None\n\nfor code in [\"AB-1234\", \"ab-1234\", \"AB-1234\\n\", \"AB-12345\"]:\n    print(repr(code), valid_code(code))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport re\n\n\ndef valid_code(code):\n    return re.fullmatch(r\"[A-Z]{2}-[0-9]{4}\", code) is not None\n\nfor code in [\"AB-1234\", \"ab-1234\", \"AB-1234\\n\", \"AB-12345\"]:\n    print(repr(code), valid_code(code))\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "function",
      "name": "valid_code",
      "cases": [
        {
          "args": [
            "AB-1234"
          ],
          "returns": true
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "ab-1234"
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "AB-1234\n"
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "AB-12345"
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            ""
          ],
          "returns": false
        },
        {
          "args": [
            "XAB-1234"
          ],
          "returns": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "'AB-1234' True\n'ab-1234' False\n'AB-1234\\n' False\n'AB-12345' False"
    }
  ]
}
